cff-version: 1.2.0
title: YOLOmatic
message: "If you use YOLOmatic in research, automation, or production workflows, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bahreini Jangjoo
    given-names: Shahab
    email: shahabahreini@hotmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/shahabahreini/YOLOMatic"
url: "https://shahabahreini.github.io/YOLOMatic/"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  YOLOmatic is a Python terminal application for the computer-vision training
  loop. An interactive wizard configures, trains, fine-tunes, benchmarks and
  exports YOLO26, YOLOv12, YOLO11, YOLOv10, YOLOv9, YOLOv8, YOLOX, RF-DETR,
  SAM 3.1 and Detectron2 models for object detection, instance and semantic
  segmentation and pose estimation, with hardware-aware configuration for
  CUDA, Apple Silicon (MPS) and CPU.
version: 7.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
keywords:
  - YOLO
  - YOLO26
  - RF-DETR
  - SAM
  - Detectron2
  - object detection
  - instance segmentation
  - semantic segmentation
  - pose estimation
  - YOLOv12
